{"id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-stages.md","title":"计算与枚举的阶段近似","display":"df-stages — 计算与枚举的阶段近似","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-stages","aliases":["20-df-stages"],"display":"df-stages — 计算与枚举的阶段近似","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 1.6.17；Theorem 1.6.18","source_pdf_pages":[53,54],"source_printed_pages":[17,18],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-tmcomp]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-stages"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-stages</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stages — 计算与枚举的阶段近似"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.6.17；Theorem 1.6.18"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17</span><span>18</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,s,y\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,s,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0(x)\">\\(c_0(x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_{P_e}\">\\(\\to_{P_e}\\)</span> 及停止配置输出约定见上游。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists(c_i)_{i\\le n}\">\\(\\exists(c_i)_{i\\le n}\\)</span> 的域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_{P_e}^{n+1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_{P_e}^{n+1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}\">\\(t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}\\)</span> 为有限支撑磁带，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stages}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nT(e,x,y,s)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,x,y&lt;s\\land\\exists n&lt;s\\ \\exists(c_i)_{i\\le n}\\ \\exists t,h\\\n[c_0=c_0(x)\\land(\\forall i&lt;n\\ c_i\\to_{P_e}c_{i+1})\\land\nc_n=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|],\\\\\n\\varphi_{e,s}(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow T(e,x,y,s),\\qquad\nW_{e,s}:=\\{x:\\exists y\\ T(e,x,y,s)\\},\\\\\nW_{e,0}=\\varnothing,\\qquad W_{e,s}\\subseteq W_{e,s+1},\\qquad W_e=\\bigcup_sW_{e,s}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stages}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nT(e,x,y,s)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,x,y&lt;s\\land\\exists n&lt;s\\ \\exists(c_i)_{i\\le n}\\ \\exists t,h\\\n[c_0=c_0(x)\\land(\\forall i&lt;n\\ c_i\\to_{P_e}c_{i+1})\\land\nc_n=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|],\\\\\n\\varphi_{e,s}(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow T(e,x,y,s),\\qquad\nW_{e,s}:=\\{x:\\exists y\\ T(e,x,y,s)\\},\\\\\nW_{e,0}=\\varnothing,\\qquad W_{e,s}\\subseteq W_{e,s+1},\\qquad W_e=\\bigcup_sW_{e,s}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有配置属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_{P_e}\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_{P_e}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为有限支撑磁带，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。有限时限模拟与整条磁带的有限支撑计数使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致可判定；状态数、磁带访问区间和计算长度均有限。约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y&lt;s\">\\(e,x,y&lt;s\\)</span> 保证每个阶段集合有限。阶段约束不改变最终函数。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.6.17；Theorem 1.6.18；印刷页 17, 18；PDF 第 53, 54 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,x,s,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"c_0(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_{P_e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists(c_i)_{i\\le n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}_{P_e}^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stages}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nT(e,x,y,s)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,x,y<s\\land\\exists n<s\\ \\exists(c_i)_{i\\le n}\\ \\exists t,h\\\n[c_0=c_0(x)\\land(\\forall i<n\\ c_i\\to_{P_e}c_{i+1})\\land\nc_n=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|],\\\\\n\\varphi_{e,s}(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow T(e,x,y,s),\\qquad\nW_{e,s}:=\\{x:\\exists y\\ T(e,x,y,s)\\},\\\\\nW_{e,0}=\\varnothing,\\qquad W_{e,s}\\subseteq W_{e,s+1},\\qquad W_e=\\bigcup_sW_{e,s}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}_{P_e}","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"e,x,y<s","display":false}],"bytes":1800,"backlinks":[{"id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"coun